<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Public Finance 6-mth net up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Public Finance 6-mth net up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  56.81   vs	  48.90</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 17.0    vs	  20.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   445.14   vs	 358.46</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    84.81   vs	  72.40</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Public Finance Bhd provides hire purchase and lease financing and housing loans.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
